{"id":"e74d03ee2e6041ba","group":"58","path":"58/batch09/58-thm-schauder-fixed-point.md","title":"Schauder Fixed Point Theorem","display":"thm-schauder-fixed-point — Schauder Fixed Point Theorem","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-schauder-fixed-point","aliases":["58-thm-schauder-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-schauder-fixed-point — Schauder Fixed Point Theorem","depends_on":["[[58-df-compact]]","[[58-df-convex]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[58-df-fixed-point]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-schauder-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-schauder-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-schauder-fixed-point — Schauder Fixed Point Theorem"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"050f6d05b2c94aea\" href=\"?note=050f6d05b2c94aea\" title=\"58-df-compact\">58-df-compact</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d57fb1b329c235bc\" href=\"?note=d57fb1b329c235bc\" title=\"58-df-convex\">58-df-convex</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"45e100357eb1d5c0\" href=\"?note=45e100357eb1d5c0\" title=\"58-df-fixed-point\">58-df-fixed-point</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau_E)\">\\((E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau_E)\\)</span> is a Hausdorff locally convex real topological vector space</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C,T\\in V\">\\(C,T\\in V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq E\">\\(C\\subseteq E\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_C\\coloneqq\\{C\\cap U:U\\in\\tau_E\\}\">\\(\\tau_C\\coloneqq\\{C\\cap U:U\\in\\tau_E\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> are the exact predicates supplied by the cited dependencies</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schauder\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\emptyset\\neq C\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(C,\\tau_C)\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,E,+_E,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(T,C,\\tau_C,C,\\tau_C)\\to\\exists x\\in C\\;(T(x)=x)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schauder\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\emptyset\\neq C\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(C,\\tau_C)\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,E,+_E,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(T,C,\\tau_C,C,\\tau_C)\\to\\exists x\\in C\\;(T(x)=x)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the Schauder–Tychonoff form for a nonempty compact convex subset of a Hausdorff locally convex topological vector space.</li>\n<li>Brouwer's theorem is recovered in finite-dimensional Euclidean spaces; the infinite-dimensional statement needs a separate compactness argument.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-compact","status":"resolved","id":"050f6d05b2c94aea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-compact]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-convex","status":"resolved","id":"d57fb1b329c235bc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-convex]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-fixed-point","status":"resolved","id":"45e100357eb1d5c0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-fixed-point]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(E,+_E,\\odot,\\tau_E)","display":false},{"tex":"C,T\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq E","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_C\\coloneqq\\{C\\cap U:U\\in\\tau_E\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Compact}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Convex}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}schauder\\text{-}fixed\\text{-}point} \\vdash \\emptyset\\neq C\\subseteq E\\land\\mathrm{Compact}_S(C,\\tau_C)\\land\\mathrm{Convex}_S(C,E,+_E,\\odot)\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(T,C,\\tau_C,C,\\tau_C)\\to\\exists x\\in C\\;(T(x)=x)","display":true}],"bytes":1312,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4407","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-thm-schauder-fixed-point.md|58-thm-schauder-fixed-point]]（batch09）"}],"outgoing":["050f6d05b2c94aea","d57fb1b329c235bc","3cd1834de4f2efb2","45e100357eb1d5c0"]}